        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Mar 4, 2026",
            "id": "9f7892ec-7d14-4d38-b1cf-9bfd286eeddf",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for the lovely review! We’re so glad Aces High was perfect for your girls’ weekend and that you enjoyed the elevator, comfortable bedding, and easy beach access. We’d love to host you again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We stayed at the beautiful Aces High property for a girls MahJong weekend. The house fit our needs perfectly! It was as described and then some. My favorite thing about the house, besides how beautiful it was, was the elevator and the comfortable bedding and bath towels. We did walk down to the beach and it was easily accessible. The host was very attentive and seemed to care that we had a good time.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "David W.",
        "date": "2025-12-05T16:40:17Z",
        "id": "69331a0eeca04d4de852fa74",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Dec 22, 2025",
            "id": "f7649e8f-5cb9-4140-b35a-676a82976828",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for the wonderful review! We’re so glad Aces High was a great fit for your group and that the layout, elevator, location, and golf cart made your stay easy and enjoyable. We appreciate your kind words about our team and are happy we could assist quickly with your requests.\nThank you as well for the feedback on the internet and channel selection, we’ll keep that in mind as we continue to improve. We’d love to host you again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Aces High was a fantastic stay! The home is HUGE, all bedrooms, rooms, common area, kitchen were very large and usable. All bedrooms were en-suite, beds, furniture all in excellent condition.Elevator was a lifsaver! We had two 80 yo's with us, no issues putting them on the third floor. Plus, very helpful on move-in / move out.ELC were stars! I requested an accomodation, which I would not have been upset if they said no. They discussed with the owners and agreed within minutes. Fantastic communication.Also, there was an issue with the pool heater. Things break, but what stood out is the attention they gave it. They had someone out that morning (Thanksgiving) to fix it. Fantastic!Property is well situated, walk to private beach area was great. Golf cart was a huge benefit, used it daily back and forth. It goes the speed of traffic, so better than a car.The only constructive criticism I have concerns the internet and channel selections. The internet was intermittent throughout our stay (likely a broader SeaGrove issue). The channel selection was limited—no ESPN, for example. Based on our experience with them, I expect they’ll update this in the future.Overall I highly recommend the home and highly rate their team. Thanks!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
